 there will be chaos in the Spirit World! What's a half-dead spirit detective to do?\n\nWith the aide of his closest allies, Yusuke sets off for Magma Valley, to save the life of the one who saved his, and find out who's at the bottom of this evil conspiracy.\n\n(Source: AnimeNfo)"},"tags":[{"name":"Super Power","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Demons","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Afterlife","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Martial Arts","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Male Cast","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Youkai","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Delinquents","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gods","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Isekai","rank":10,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Yu Yu Hakusho: The Movie","english":"Yu Yu Hakusho: The Movie","native":"幽☆遊☆白書 (1993)","romaji":"Yuu☆Yuu☆Hakusho: The Golden Seal","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"幽☆遊☆白書"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"幽游白书 夜叉的阴谋"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"幽☆遊☆白書 (映画)"}]},"trailer":{"id":"1BJR5cJz_ZU?t=8","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1BJR5cJz_ZU?t=8/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}